  "description": "Operating Area: Summer 2026: Ireland, Netherlands, Norway, Portugal, Denmark, UK, Baltic Sea\n\nTHANDEKA, a 37-meter masterpiece, is the result of a collaboration between the renowned shipyard Camper & Nicholsons and the design firm Dubois Naval Architects. Crafted to deliver an unparalleled cruising experience, this yacht perfectly blends elegant design, exceptional comfort, and outstanding sailing performance. Whether you're seeking a relaxing getaway or an adventurous sea voyage, THANDEKA will exceed your highest expectations.\n\nTHANDEKA can accommodate up to eight guests in its four luxurious and spacious cabins, offering all the modern amenities. The bright deck salon, featuring 360-degree panoramic views, is the perfect space to unwind and take in the stunning ocean scenery. Every part of the yacht has been meticulously designed to maximize the comfort and well-being of its guests.\n\nWith a professional crew on board, every detail is attended to, ensuring a flawless cruising experience. In addition to impeccable service, guests can enjoy a wide range of water activities, such as snorkeling, paddleboarding, and much more. The crew is dedicated to making each moment on board truly unforgettable.\n\nTHANDEKA offers a high-end sailing experience, whether cruising through tropical waters or temperate regions, effortlessly combining adventure and tranquility.\n\nNow available in the the Baltic Sea, Ireland, UK, Netherlands and Norway in summer 2026",
